- @page_title = "Join the Team"
.container
  %h1.title= @page_title
  %p.lead Action.IO is revolutionizing the way the world builds applications by moving your development runtime to the cloud. We are looking for remarkable people to help us effect the next paradigm shift in programming.
  %p Action.IO was founded in July of 2012 and has offices in San Francisco and Singapore.
  .row
    .span8
      %article#jobs
        #jpost
          %h3 Dev Ops Engineer
          %p.desc Dev Ops are the heart of the Action.IO platform. You are an automation wizard, you have rube goldberg&rsquo;ed your entire morning routine, and you are looking to take those skills elsewhere.
          %p.reqs
            %ul
              %li Familiarity with Amazon Web Services
              %li Experience administering large scale production server environments
              %li Solid knowledge of scripting languages
              %li Ability to identify and smash performance bottlenecks
              %li Familiarity with common open source web service infrastructure: Nginx, HAProxy, Memcached, Redis, PostgreSQL, etc
              %li Experience with monitoring systems and configuration management tools like Chef, Puppet, Capistrano, Nagios, Cacti, etc.
              %li A degree in Computer Science or related technical field

          %p.actions
            To apply, please send your CV &amp; github profile to
            = mail_to "jobs@action.io", "jobs@action.io",:encode => "javascript"

        #jpost
          %h3 Software Engineer
          %p.desc
            Want to know the secret to our kickass product? We use Action.IO to build Action.IO.
          %p.reqs
            %ul
              %li Solid knowledge of Ruby on Rails, Node.js, Test-Driven Development, and Front-end Frameworks like Backbone and Ember
              %li Ability to learn and implement new and unfamiliar technologies
              %li A passion for cloud computing and optimization
              %li Obsessive attention to detail
              %li Risk taker, not afraid to break things to push the envelope of whats possible
              %li Experience in building massive-scale production quality systems
              %li A degree in Computer Science or related technical field

          %p.actions
            To apply, please send your CV &amp; github profile to
            = mail_to "jobs@action.io", "jobs@action.io",:encode => "javascript"

    .span3.offset1
      #sidebar
        %h3 Action Perks
        %p
          %ul
            %li Equity in a fast growing startup
            %li Beer (or Juice) Fridays
            %li Hipster Fixed-gear Bike
            %li Gym Stipend
            %li Latest Apple Laptop
            %li Weekly Company Hackathons

